# SPA fallback.
#
# This is a client-rendered app (ssr: false), so only index.html physically
# exists. Without this rule, loading or refreshing a deep link such as
# /products or /quotations/new returns a Netlify 404 — the Vue router never
# gets a chance to handle the route.
#
# Status 200 (not 301/302) so the URL is preserved for the router.
/*    /index.html   200
